  "title": "Dog Food Dip",
  "description": "This \"dog food\" dip is a simple and spicy mixture of creamy beef, cheese, and jalapeño peppers. Serve warm with your favorite corn chips.",
  "authors": [
    "Cindy Carnes"
  ],
